  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Interamericano de Finanzas S.A.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this IIC operation is to provide BanBIF with up to US$9 million in financing to support small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in Peru though loans for working capital, the modernization and/or expansion of these enterprises, and/or financial leasing operations, pursuant to eligibility criteria to be established by the IIC.BanBIF is a finance company that provides financial intermediation services as a private commercial bank geared primarily to Peruvian SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
